# Copy to .dev.vars for local `wrangler dev` (that file is gitignored).
# In production these are set with `wrangler secret put <NAME>`, not committed.

# Shared secret the Worker sends as `Authorization: Bearer <value>` on every
# call to Threadwise. Threadwise's own API does not check this (see
# README.md "Threadwise has no API authentication") — a reverse proxy in
# front of Threadwise must reject requests that don't present it.
CRM_SHARED_SECRET=change-me-to-a-long-random-value
